<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Molecular Devices started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Molecular Devices started.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Madison Securities analyst William Plovanic said he started coverage of Molecular Devices Corp as a buy.</p>
<p>--Shares in the bioanalytical measurement systems and reagents manufacturer were up 7/8 to 10-1/2.</p>
<p>--The company is a &quot;market leader with no competition in two out of three product lines,&quot; Plovanic said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
